'''Dead Donny Dash''' (ダッシュ死太郎 ''Dasshu Shitarō'', '''Shitarō Dash''' [''shi = death'']) is a [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie]] variant of [[The Face]] introduced in the [[Sports Night (Monthly Event)|Sports Night]] event. He was added in [[Version 7.4 Update|Version 7.4]].

