==Enemy==
The Zombie variant of [[Dashing Face]]. He appears to be a Dashing Face with purple hair that covers up most of his head, sporting a white bandana and purple shoes. Unlike Dashing Face and his legless variants, Dead Donny Dash attacks by flinging his shoe into the air, which then expands and comes crashing down. In practice, he behaves less like Dashing Face and more like a faster [[Tackey]] with Zombie attributes and a smaller blind spot.

==Strategy==
He's a lot faster than Tackey, so you can let him burrow, get close, and use cats like [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] or [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Maglev Cat]] to enter his range and destroy him with ease.

